
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Client
    participant API as Audit.Api
    participant SQL as SQL Server
    participant Outbox as Outbox Publisher
    participant Queue as Azure Storage Queue
    participant Worker as Audit.Processor
    participant Cosmos as Cosmos DB

    Client->>API: POST /policies/{id}/status
    API->>API: Validate JWT and authorisation

    API->>SQL: Begin transaction
    API->>SQL: Update policy
    API->>SQL: Insert OutboxMessage (EventId)
    SQL-->>API: Commit transaction

    API-->>Client: Success response

    Note over SQL,Outbox: Publisher retrieves unpublished outbox records

    Outbox->>SQL: Read pending OutboxMessages
    SQL-->>Outbox: Event payload + EventId

    Outbox->>Queue: Send audit event
    Queue-->>Outbox: Message accepted

    Outbox->>SQL: Mark OutboxMessage as published

    Worker->>Queue: Retrieve message
    Queue-->>Worker: Audit event + EventId

    Worker->>Worker: Validate and resolve tenant
    Worker->>Cosmos: Persist document (ID = EventId)

    alt New event
        Cosmos-->>Worker: Persisted successfully
    else Duplicate event
        Cosmos-->>Worker: Existing document detected
        Note over Worker,Cosmos: Treat duplicate as successfully processed
    end

    Worker->>Queue: Delete message after successful persistence

    Note over Queue,Cosmos: Failed processing must not result in premature message deletion
